.TH YR-DEPS 1 "" YARA-X "User Commands"
.SH NAME
yr\-deps \- Show rule dependencies
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fByr deps\fR [\fB\-r\fR|\fB\-\-rule\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIRULES_PATH\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show rule dependencies
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-r\fR, \fB\-\-rule\fR
Rules to display dependency information for
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIRULES_PATH\fR>
Path to YARA source file
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fByr\fR(1)
